        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1488, Angled Roller Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese angled roller bumpers are used in situations where 2 doors open against each other. Normally it is screwed to one of the doors at the top very near the doors edge. After installation when both doors are open, the roller wheel will protect the doors and their hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1488_size.gif?v=1704354551\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1488 roller door bumper size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Straight version <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-inch-roller-bumper-don-jo-1486\"><b>4-1/2\" Roller Door Bumper</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-roller-door-bumper-don-jo-1487\"><b>6\" Roller Door Bumper</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of heavy duty solid cast brass in your choice of 3 finish colors. Packaged complete with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 1488 Angled Roller Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base: 2-1/4\" x 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Roller Wheel Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1488.pdf?v=1704262275\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1488 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
