                "description": "Don-Jo 1488 Roller Bumper. These angled roller bumpers are used in situations where 2 doors open against each other. Normally it is screwed to one of the doors at the top very near the doors edge. After installation when both doors are open, the roller wheel will protect the doors and their hardware. Constructed of heavy duty solid cast brass in your choice of 3 finish colors. Packaged complete with mounting hardware.",
